#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:5 d4016b77640f4f3aba93935c8c878864
msgid "GCS Failsafe"
msgstr "地面站故障保护"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:6 85f32d4a1f514aafaea5646b79c43351
msgid ""
"The Ground Station Control (GCS) failsafe controls how Sub will behave if "
"contact with the GCS is lost.  The GCS failsafe monitors the time since the "
"last MAVLink heartbeat from the GCS.  If no heartbeat is received "
":ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` seconds (Default is 5 seconds), the "
"GCS failsafe event will trigger based on your parameter settings. Note that "
"if no GCS is ever connected, the GCS failsafe will remain inactive "
"regardless of parameter settings."
msgstr ""
"地面站控制（GCS）故障保护控制水下机器人在失去与地面站联系时的行为。地面站故障保护监控自上次收到地面站 MAVLink 心跳包以来的时间。如果在 "
":ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` 秒内（默认 5 "
"秒）未收到心跳包，将根据参数设置触发地面站故障保护事件。请注意，如果从未连接地面站，无论参数如何设置，地面站故障保护将保持非激活状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:10 bf50e004688e431b8a8fecaa1af9f13f
msgid ""
"Sub also supports other failsafes, see the :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`."
msgstr "水下机器人还支持其他故障保护，请参见 :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:13 ae5eb2c58f2a47f39e2072b70dc75b66
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "何时触发故障保护"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:14 82ed5c8f6eb34584851327e810b37a34
msgid ""
"The following situations can cause a loss of GCS MAVLink heartbeat, "
"triggering a GCS failsafe event after :ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` "
"seconds:"
msgstr ""
"以下情况可能导致地面站 MAVLink 心跳包丢失，并在 :ref:`FS_GCS_TIMEOUT<FS_GCS_TIMEOUT>` "
"秒后触发地面站故障保护事件："

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:16 536d5daac6c84ff49b2ea0ecc62f8b60
msgid "The operator turns off or otherwise disconnects the GCS"
msgstr "操作员关闭或断开地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:17 4722b109f5ef45859421b114430e6b96
msgid "The vehicle travels beyond the range of the GCS telemetry radios"
msgstr "飞行器超出地面站遥测无线电的通信范围"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:18 074d2c3aab1544baa6e94df72bda38fe
msgid "The GCS telemetry mechanism on either end loses power"
msgstr "任一端的地面站遥测设备断电"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:19 35aa5d5b4c8b4401b28b11ed4c5fbb03
msgid ""
"Wires connecting the GCS telemetry to the autopilot or ground equipment "
"become disconnected"
msgstr "连接地面站遥测与自动驾驶仪或地面设备的线缆断开"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:22 a4d9f8173f7e477cbf27b345adc5b629
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:23 b061460021694653a34e75e34699ca1b
msgid ""
"When a GCS failsafe is triggered, the vehicle can be configured via "
"parameters to do nothing, send the GCS a warning message, disarm, or change "
"to ALTHOLD or SURFACE modes."
msgstr ""
"地面站故障保护触发时，可通过参数将飞行器配置为：不采取任何动作、向地面站发送警告消息、锁定电机，或切换至定高（ALTHOLD）或上浮（Surface）模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:26 45693e964c574195b5f9f2514c91936a
msgid ""
"If the failsafe clears (i.e. GCS reconnects and MAVLink heartbeat is "
"restored) the vehicle will remain in its failsafe mode. It will **not** "
"automatically return to the flight mode that was active before the failsafe "
"was triggered, if it was changed."
msgstr ""
"如果故障保护解除（即地面站重新连接且 MAVLink "
"心跳包恢复），飞行器将保持在故障保护模式。如果已切换模式，将**不会**自动恢复到故障保护触发前的飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:29 16fada90f9114a42b01fb9fb4b2555ed
msgid "Setting the failsafe"
msgstr "设置故障保护"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:31 d5ae5eae92334fde8d11b2e7d91da925
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner's  full parameter list or full parameter tree, set the "
":ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` parameter to:"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的完整参数列表或完整参数树中，将 :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABLE <FS_GCS_ENABLE>` "
"参数设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:33 b5f7aab3049d4875aeb11fe890d07358
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the GCS failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用**（值 0）将完全禁用地面站故障保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:34 8a65592499c946dd853fd3836fc124cb
msgid "**Warn Only** (Value 1) will send a GCS warning message."
msgstr "**仅警告**（值 1）将向地面站发送警告消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:35 3856de0149d84465b725c917c345b56b
msgid "**Disarm** (Value 2)"
msgstr "**锁定**（值 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:36 7153065f074c424e82b439835824d798
msgid ""
"**Enter ALTHOLD mode** (Value 3), if armed. If mode change fails, disarm."
msgstr "**进入 ALTHOLD 模式**（值 3），如已解锁。如模式切换失败，则锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/gcs-failsafe.rst:37 5572a13a21b748e4a46c2599f9528369
msgid ""
"**Enter SURFACE mode** (Value 4), if armed. If mode change fails, disarm."
msgstr "**进入 Surface 模式**（值 4），如已解锁。如模式切换失败，则锁定。"
